  "rule_name": "Rule 15 verbatim headline-tier decision rule",
  "headline_tier_rule": "A (model, seed, budget) cell is shift_affected if the nominal budget lies outside the Clopper-Pearson 95% CI of the realized Tier-A held-out control FPR. If no cell is shift_affected, Tier A is the headline tier and Tier B is a robustness table. If any cell is shift_affected, Tier B is the headline tier for all matched-FPR recall/F2 claims and Tier A is reported as the partition-shifted operating point. Tiers are never mixed within one comparison table. (Identical to Rule 15; committed before S3 runs.)",
